    {
        "content": "<p>The reason for this regression is that <code>grind</code> now uses the pattern <code>num (toType f.s) &lt; num α</code> (or, to be precise <code>num (toType f.s) + 1 ≤ num α</code>). You can still use <code>grind only [→ foo]</code> to make it work though.</p>",
